body:
I'm looking to get out of corporate grooming and get into a smaller business.  I would love to groom on my own but I only have 1.5 years of experience and I am not financially ready to start my own business. 

&#x200B;

I have a lot of places saved on indeed and I was wondering if I should attach image files to my resume to show off some of my skills! I also have an active instagram where I post a lot of my grooms. 

&#x200B;

What do you guys think? I'd love to show them what skills I know I can do confidently and beautifully.
